+/// alphabet, padded) over [`canonical_request`]: CC 2.6.1.7
+/// ML-DSA-65-Ed25519, 3373 bytes (`mldsaSig || ed25519Sig`). It replaces the
+/// two component headers (`x-ciris-signature-ed25519` +
